---
import Icon from '~/components/Icon.astro';
import { appLinks, hero } from '~/lib/marketing';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-8 pb-12 md:pt-12 md:pb-16 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-20">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-[-14rem] h-[38rem] w-[64rem] max-w-[100vw] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgb(var(--color-brand)/0.16),transparent_60%)] blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-[-8rem] top-20 h-[24rem] w-[24rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgb(var(--color-accent)/0.14),transparent_62%)] blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-app grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-brand">
        <img src="/assets/brand/logo-256.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" class="h-5 w-5 object-contain" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <span class="font-mono text-fluid-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em]">Glitch Trade rev 4</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-[15ch]">Glitch Trade &mdash; the platform to run, test, and track AI trading automation.</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-fluid-lg italic text-brand">Prop-firm challenge tracking included.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[60ch] text-fluid-lg text-muted">{hero.intro}</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[60ch] text-fluid-base text-subtle">
        Run a simple swing rule. Wire a TradingView alert into execution. Pre-flight a challenge setup. Open the code editor when you need full control. Same platform, broader audience.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href={appLinks.signup} class="btn btn-primary" data-cta="hero-start-free">
          Start free
          <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} />
        </a>
        <a href={appLinks.quick} class="btn btn-ghost" data-cta="hero-quick-rule">
          Try a quick rule
          <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16} />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-fluid-xs text-subtle">
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border/70 bg-surface/60 px-3 py-1.5">Quick rule</span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border/70 bg-surface/60 px-3 py-1.5">Visual builder</span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border/70 bg-surface/60 px-3 py-1.5">Code editor</span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border/70 bg-surface/60 px-3 py-1.5">Firm Mode</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal lg:justify-self-end">
      <div class="card overflow-hidden border-brand/20 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgb(var(--color-surface-2)/0.82),rgb(var(--color-bg)/0.88))] p-5 shadow-[0_24px_60px_-36px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border/60 pb-3">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow"><Icon name="code" size={14} /> live example</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-sm text-fg">Quick rule to Firm Mode</p>
          </div>
          <img src="/assets/brand/logo-512.png" alt="Snake glyph for Glitch Trade" width="48" height="48" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-bg/70 p-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-fluid-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-subtle">Run</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-sm text-fg">buy BTCUSD at 80000, sell at 81000</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-xs text-subtle">Quick-rule parser turns plain English into a live automation draft.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-bg/70 p-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-fluid-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-subtle">Test</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-sm text-fg">Historical bars + optional firm-rule guardrails</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-xs text-subtle">Backtest the exact setup before money or a prop challenge is on the line.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-brand/8 p-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-fluid-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand">Track</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-sm text-fg">Universal dashboard with Firm Mode when you need it</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-fluid-xs text-subtle">One account view for casual trading, experiments, and challenge monitoring.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
